WEBVTT

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:14.640
Thank you for waiting.

00:00:14.640 --> 00:00:17.800
It spoils quickly,

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:20.350
so please eat it within a couple of days.

00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:21.470
Okay, thank you.
so please eat it within a couple of days.

00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:23.010
Okay, thank you.

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:25.550
Thank you for coming.

00:00:25.550 --> 00:00:30.150
If anyone else is ready, I can take their order.

00:00:30.860 --> 00:00:32.650
Welcome.

00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:34.370
Yes, go ahead.

00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:45.630
We'll be together forever, okay?

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:49.340
Yuki-chan...

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:00.790
Um...

00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:06.700
Does this mean I'll go to the studio while you work,

00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:10.990
and you'll earn the tuition for it?

00:01:10.990 --> 00:01:12.970
Yeah, that's right.

00:01:12.970 --> 00:01:16.490
But what about your own studies?

00:01:16.490 --> 00:01:18.060
I'll be studying too.

00:01:18.410 --> 00:01:20.210
No one's the same,

00:01:20.210 --> 00:01:25.990
but I did check on how much I should work while keeping up with academics.

00:01:25.990 --> 00:01:29.280
Oh, but it seems they require a deposit upfront,

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:32.570
so I'm planning to ask Dad for help on that.

00:01:32.570 --> 00:01:36.340
And I know there's no guarantee that I'll pass the exam either.

00:01:36.340 --> 00:01:38.850
But yours definitely looks more difficult.

00:01:38.850 --> 00:01:43.050
So don't worry about our finances, okay?

00:01:43.050 --> 00:01:45.600
I thought this would work out.

00:01:46.290 --> 00:01:47.780
Kana-chan, Kana-chan.

00:01:47.780 --> 00:01:49.210
Say "Ah!"

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:51.390
You crazy?

00:01:52.560 --> 00:01:54.050
Do you not like chocolate-flavored one?

00:01:54.050 --> 00:01:56.500
Why do you always do this?

00:01:56.500 --> 00:02:00.220
You're always concerned about what I want and not what you want.

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:04.550
But watching you do it makes me hate myself.

00:02:04.550 --> 00:02:06.860
I'm always too dependent on you.

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:14.620
Like how I totally expected you to come along when I said I wanted to go to school in Tokyo.

00:02:14.620 --> 00:02:15.860
Kana-chan...

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:17.240
And besides,

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:23.700
all that financial stuff I said was just an excuse, so it's even worse.

00:02:23.700 --> 00:02:25.530
An excuse?

00:02:26.650 --> 00:02:31.220
If I start going to the studio, I'll be heading there right after school,

00:02:31.220 --> 00:02:35.520
and by the time I get home, it'll be past 11:00.

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:41.630
I really don't want that to become the norm and have so much less time to spend with you.

00:02:41.630 --> 00:02:45.150
Besides, you working while I go to school?

00:02:45.150 --> 00:02:48.100
That's totally wrong.

00:02:48.100 --> 00:02:49.280
Why?

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:52.510
You really don't need to worry about that.

00:02:52.510 --> 00:02:53.760
But...

00:02:53.760 --> 00:02:57.300
We'll have less time to spend with each other for now,

00:02:59.290 --> 00:03:03.110
but if that allows us to stay together forever in the future,

00:03:03.110 --> 00:03:05.970
I think it's the best way.

00:03:07.510 --> 00:03:09.750
I see that point too.

00:03:09.750 --> 00:03:15.580
But I want to stay with you both now and in the future.

00:03:15.580 --> 00:03:17.840
Me too.

00:03:17.840 --> 00:03:23.330
But there are times when we'll have to pick one or the other, Kana-chan.

00:03:23.330 --> 00:03:24.440
Yeah.

00:03:24.440 --> 00:03:28.340
I'm sorry, Yuki-chan, for taking this out on you.

00:03:29.440 --> 00:03:31.390
I know I sounded silly too.

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:36.450
But would you consider that possibility, Kana-chan?

00:03:37.430 --> 00:03:38.190
Yeah.

00:03:41.510 --> 00:03:45.450
You know, sometimes I'm envious of her.
You're more snuggable and cuddly than New Year's day!

00:03:45.450 --> 00:03:46.940
I can't hold back anymore.

00:03:46.940 --> 00:03:47.830
Saku-chan really is quite something, in many senses...

00:03:47.830 --> 00:03:50.470
Ah, Kanade-senpai...

00:03:50.470 --> 00:03:53.550
I'm glad you recovered, Saku-chan.

00:03:53.550 --> 00:03:55.500
Yup! I don't give up that easily.

00:03:55.500 --> 00:03:56.390
Come on, give it up.

00:03:56.390 --> 00:03:58.470
I did more research after that,

00:03:58.470 --> 00:04:01.000
and I found out that we can switch rooms again for the new school year.

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:02.740
That means, next year...

00:04:02.740 --> 00:04:04.400
Um, Saku-chan.

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:05.340
Yes?

00:04:05.880 --> 00:04:07.350
You tell her, Yuki-chan.

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:09.740
What grade will you be in next year?

00:04:09.740 --> 00:04:11.780
Um, second year.

00:04:11.780 --> 00:04:13.630
Then, what about us?

00:04:13.630 --> 00:04:16.330
On your third year, obvi...

00:04:16.330 --> 00:04:17.940
Now you see.

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:20.130
No! No!

00:04:20.130 --> 00:04:21.960
Please, Senpai! Fail a year!

00:04:21.960 --> 00:04:24.360
No, I can't do that.
Please, Senpai! Fail a year!

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:27.500
Then please go to our academy's university!

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:27.720
Why would I do that?

00:04:27.720 --> 00:04:30.720
That way, you can stay in the dorm!

00:04:30.720 --> 00:04:32.410
You better give it up already.
Bathe with me...

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:35.440
I mean, I want the same room as you!

00:04:35.440 --> 00:04:37.430
Senpai! Senpai!

00:04:44.120 --> 00:04:46.650
Oh, it's from Yuki-chan.

00:04:49.230 --> 00:04:51.480
So, what's going on, Yuki-chan?

00:04:51.480 --> 00:04:53.080
What about?

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:55.390
Work.

00:04:55.630 --> 00:04:58.870
I thought you were going to do it after you retired from your club.

00:04:58.870 --> 00:05:02.220
Yeah, I was, but...

00:05:02.220 --> 00:05:03.320
But?

00:05:04.510 --> 00:05:07.480
While I was thinking about our future,

00:05:07.480 --> 00:05:15.140
I thought that maybe I should start working sooner since we'll need rent and such after we graduate.

00:05:15.140 --> 00:05:17.390
That might be, but—

00:05:17.390 --> 00:05:22.970
It's not like you're starting cram school as soon as I start working,

00:05:22.970 --> 00:05:26.090
and you'll be the one to decide when to start.

00:05:26.090 --> 00:05:29.820
My point isn't about the studio,

00:05:29.820 --> 00:05:30.990
but like I said before...

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:34.210
Oh, the train's here,

00:05:34.210 --> 00:05:36.600
so let's talk about this later.

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:39.070
Okay.

00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:40.940
I'll head home first then.

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:41.800
Yeah.

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:43.740
See ya, Kana-chan.

00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:44.710
Yeah.

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:53.050
What am I doing?

00:05:53.170 --> 00:05:55.820
Hey! Don't walk in front of me!

00:05:55.820 --> 00:05:57.430
Th-This is no good.

00:05:57.430 --> 00:06:00.880
Let's see... delete, delete...

00:06:00.880 --> 00:06:03.040
Anyway, that's really cool, Senpai.

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:04.350
On your first try, right?

00:06:04.350 --> 00:06:09.750
Well, I picked one outside of Tokyo, so there wasn't much competition.

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:13.710
Senpai, I don't want any of your buttons, but give me some of your art supplies instead.

00:06:13.710 --> 00:06:15.840
No, you got it backwards.

00:06:15.840 --> 00:06:19.810
You're supposed to give me something, normally.

00:06:19.810 --> 00:06:23.310
By the way, you're looking at other colleges, right?

00:06:23.310 --> 00:06:24.450
Well, yes.

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:27.550
It's so much easier to advance within this academy.

00:06:27.550 --> 00:06:30.980
It's not like you're moving back home, unlike Senpai.

00:06:30.980 --> 00:06:35.580
The teacher I want to study under is teaching somewhere else, so I can't help it.

00:06:35.580 --> 00:06:40.720
Then you should at least attend the short-term studio.

00:06:40.720 --> 00:06:45.600
Well, I know, but I have a lot going on...

00:06:46.240 --> 00:06:50.770
A same-school environment like this place can be a little too constraining,

00:06:50.770 --> 00:06:54.770
so I think this'll be a good chance to experience other points of view.

00:06:54.770 --> 00:06:56.990
Of course, it'll be good from a technical perspective too.

00:06:56.990 --> 00:07:00.180
Senpai, look this way.

00:07:18.840 --> 00:07:22.490
I'll go wherever you go!

00:07:31.750 --> 00:07:33.450
I'm home, Kana-chan.

00:07:33.450 --> 00:07:35.280
Welcome home.

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:38.530
It's March, but it still gets cold in the evening.

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:41.820
Oh, look, look!

00:07:41.820 --> 00:07:44.540
I brought home some leftovers again.

00:07:44.540 --> 00:07:46.930
Which one do you want, Kana-chan?

00:07:47.570 --> 00:07:49.320
Not right now.

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:52.300
I'll have some later, so put it in the fridge.

00:07:52.300 --> 00:07:53.830
You sure?

00:07:54.280 --> 00:07:58.240
Then I'll go ahead and take this banana custard one.

00:07:58.750 --> 00:08:00.260
Actually, I'll have one.

00:08:01.060 --> 00:08:02.820
What was that, Kana-chan?

00:08:02.820 --> 00:08:06.190
The banana one...

00:08:06.190 --> 00:08:08.420
I mean, you're so not fair.

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:16.000
It really feels like it's been a while.

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:17.800
Yeah, it does.

00:08:17.800 --> 00:08:19.120
Isn't that odd?

00:08:19.120 --> 00:08:21.900
It's only been a couple days since we last went home together.

00:08:21.900 --> 00:08:22.880
Yeah.

00:08:23.670 --> 00:08:25.090
I'm sorry, Kana-chan.

00:08:25.090 --> 00:08:27.190
It's not your fault.

00:08:27.190 --> 00:08:30.260
I think it's mine.

00:08:30.260 --> 00:08:31.930
Okay...

00:08:31.930 --> 00:08:33.630
But still, I'm sorry.

00:08:34.380 --> 00:08:35.990
I'm sorry too.

00:08:38.050 --> 00:08:40.760
Oh, Nee-chan, welcome home.

00:08:40.760 --> 00:08:42.510
Hi!
Yeah, hi...

00:08:42.510 --> 00:08:43.220
Yeah, hi...

00:08:45.160 --> 00:08:45.880
Shi-chan?! Wh-What the heck are you doing here?!

00:08:45.880 --> 00:08:48.250
It's Shi-chan!

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:52.340
You told me you couldn't come home for spring break, so I came to visit.

00:08:52.340 --> 00:08:55.600
Hold on. You should still call ahead...

00:08:55.600 --> 00:08:58.270
Wait, what about school?

00:08:58.270 --> 00:09:00.740
I thought spring break hadn't started yet.

00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:05.290
They're remodeling the gym, so it started a week early.

00:09:05.290 --> 00:09:06.540
Didn't I tell you?

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:08.420
News to me!

00:09:08.420 --> 00:09:09.750
So, who paid for the trip?

00:09:09.750 --> 00:09:11.310
Is Mom paying for this?

00:09:11.310 --> 00:09:16.110
I have my own savings, unlike some sisters of mine.

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:17.500
Um...

00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:19.830
Th-Then, where are you staying?

00:09:19.830 --> 00:09:21.130
Here.

00:09:22.560 --> 00:09:23.330
Where?

00:09:23.330 --> 00:09:25.620
Right here.

00:09:27.260 --> 00:09:28.300
Here?

00:09:28.300 --> 00:09:30.090
Where else?

00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:33.030
Do you really need to ask twice?

00:09:33.030 --> 00:09:34.000
Hold it!

00:09:34.000 --> 00:09:34.960
We can't arrange that!

00:09:34.960 --> 00:09:37.020
We won't get permission today since you just arri—

00:09:38.640 --> 00:09:40.530
I'm glad it worked out for you, Shi-chan!

00:09:40.530 --> 00:09:44.390
You're a girl, and the resident director remembered that you've been here before,

00:09:44.840 --> 00:09:47.150
so permission was granted right away.

00:09:47.150 --> 00:09:49.780
Oh, use the upper bunk again.

00:09:49.780 --> 00:09:50.720
Okay!

00:09:50.720 --> 00:09:54.580
Oh, Yuki-neechan, here's some cookies to thank you for yours.

00:09:54.580 --> 00:09:56.470
We had some around, so I brought them.

00:09:56.470 --> 00:09:59.240
Thank you, Shi-chan!

00:09:59.240 --> 00:10:01.740
And, Kana-neechan,

00:10:01.740 --> 00:10:04.970
why are you acting like I wasn't supposed to come?

00:10:05.590 --> 00:10:10.750
Well, I know you wanted to surprise us,

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:13.990
but next time, please call us before you come.

00:10:13.990 --> 00:10:18.830
It's not safe for a girl to travel alone, and we'll go to the airport to pick you up.

00:10:19.210 --> 00:10:22.260
But still, thank you for coming.

00:10:23.460 --> 00:10:25.790
Okay.

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:27.980
I'm sorry, Kana-neechan.

00:10:33.680 --> 00:10:35.430
Shi-chan...

00:10:35.430 --> 00:10:36.720
Yes?

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:37.820
Um...

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:39.460
What are you doing?

00:10:39.460 --> 00:10:41.540
I mean, you look scary that way.

00:10:41.540 --> 00:10:44.980
Blood'll rush to your head, Shi-chan.

00:10:46.410 --> 00:10:49.670
It looks warmer down there.

00:10:49.670 --> 00:10:55.420
Well, yeah, but it'll be a bit tight for the three of us in this bed...

00:10:55.420 --> 00:10:57.720
Ah, I'm jealous that you're so lovey-dovey.

00:10:57.720 --> 00:10:59.090
What, wait...

00:11:00.680 --> 00:11:02.180
Then should I go up there?

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:05.220
What? You're leaving me?

00:11:05.220 --> 00:11:07.220
But Shi-chan is...

00:11:07.220 --> 00:11:08.850
Don't be mean to Yuki-neechan, Kana-neechan.

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:10.770
But what about me?

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:13.310
Ah, I'm cold.
What? Why is it my fault?

00:11:13.310 --> 00:11:13.900
That's not right!

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:14.940
You're really going to Shi-chan's, Kana-chan?
Anyway, good night.

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:16.730
Now you're leaving us?

00:11:16.730 --> 00:11:17.820
And you! You've been listening too, so you know what's going on!

00:11:17.820 --> 00:11:21.410
Fine, I'll go ahead and sleep all alone.

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:22.030
Hmph!

00:11:22.030 --> 00:11:25.450
Ah, what am I supposed to do...

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:30.540
It's been so long since we've done this.

00:11:30.540 --> 00:11:33.830
You really better head back after a couple stations.

00:11:33.830 --> 00:11:36.710
And please go straight back to the dorm.

00:11:36.710 --> 00:11:38.960
It's not safe to wander off.

00:11:38.960 --> 00:11:40.880
I know.

00:11:40.880 --> 00:11:43.720
You nag more than Mom.

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:46.100
Just like some of the ladies in the neighborhood.

00:11:46.100 --> 00:11:49.390
I'm only concerned about you...

00:11:49.390 --> 00:11:54.690
But it's Saturday, so Kana-chan should be home by early afternoon.

00:11:54.690 --> 00:11:56.320
Okay, Shi-chan?

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:59.570
Yeah, I'll be waiting in the dorm.

00:11:59.570 --> 00:12:01.450
What about you, Yuki-neechan?

00:12:01.450 --> 00:12:05.660
Well, I have work today.

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:07.120
You started working?

00:12:07.120 --> 00:12:07.530
Yeah.

00:12:07.530 --> 00:12:09.500
Why?

00:12:09.500 --> 00:12:12.040
Is there something you want?

00:12:13.450 --> 00:12:16.920
For various things in the future, I guess.

00:12:18.090 --> 00:12:21.380
Oh, I'll bring home stuff from work, so wait with Kana-chan.

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:24.590
Why is their little sister here?

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:26.140
Anyway... click...

00:12:26.140 --> 00:12:27.850
Stop!

00:12:27.850 --> 00:12:32.310
But I don't really think I should interrupt them right now...

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:33.390
Jeez!

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:35.520
What should I do?

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:37.980
Wait... huh...

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:16.810
Thank you so much, Kanade-senpai.

00:13:16.810 --> 00:13:21.780
It totally doesn't measure up to what you gave us, but enjoy it if you'd like.

00:13:21.780 --> 00:13:25.490
Yes, I'll savor it slowly over half a year.

00:13:25.490 --> 00:13:27.910
Ah, I'm so glad I'm alive.

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:31.700
Uh, it's really nothing special.

00:13:31.700 --> 00:13:35.660
Anyway, I have plans for today, so I'll be heading home now.

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:38.080
Um, Kanade-senpai.

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:39.210
What is it?

00:13:39.210 --> 00:13:43.420
This might be unnecessary,

00:13:43.420 --> 00:13:46.180
but I think you should make up with Yukino-senpai soon.

00:13:46.180 --> 00:13:48.720
Why do you...

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:54.770
Please, Kanade-senpai.

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:58.400
I'm sorry, Saku-chan.

00:13:58.400 --> 00:13:59.480
No problem.

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:02.940
I'm in love with you being your normal self.

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:07.030
I'm home, Shi-chan.

00:14:07.030 --> 00:14:08.450
Did you get home okay?

00:14:08.450 --> 00:14:11.950
Ah, dumb nee-chan is home.

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:14.750
What's with that mean greeting?

00:14:14.750 --> 00:14:15.910
Nothing much.

00:14:15.910 --> 00:14:17.370
Just stating the fact.

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:21.040
I'm just saying you're as dumb as ever.

00:14:21.040 --> 00:14:23.210
Why are you...

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:26.720
This is why Yuki-neechan is working, right?

00:14:28.550 --> 00:14:30.390
Just as I thought.

00:14:30.390 --> 00:14:34.560
It doesn't make sense for Yuki-neechan to be working otherwise.

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:36.850
What's going on?

00:14:37.480 --> 00:14:39.230
But...

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:43.820
You know, Kana-neechan,

00:14:45.230 --> 00:14:48.860
do you remember what you told me last year?

00:14:48.860 --> 00:14:51.370
Well, sort of.

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:54.490
You said it yourself, Kana-neechan!

00:14:54.890 --> 00:14:58.830
"We can't change our distance from you, but we still care about you."

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:05.840
It's not like spending less time together will change anything between you two,

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:08.470
and you're so much more fortunate than me.

00:15:08.470 --> 00:15:11.510
Yes, that's very true.

00:15:11.510 --> 00:15:14.930
Also, you said that you might come home if it doesn't work out,

00:15:14.930 --> 00:15:18.180
but what are you planning to do with Yuki-neechan if that happens?

00:15:18.180 --> 00:15:22.770
Are you going to depend on her to do something for you again?

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:26.150
I'm not...

00:15:27.110 --> 00:15:29.820
Actually, I think I am.

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:32.950
I always depend so much on Yuki-chan.

00:15:32.950 --> 00:15:34.370
I'm sorry, Shi-chan.

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:37.040
You're apologizing to the wrong person.

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:38.160
Yeah.

00:15:38.160 --> 00:15:40.830
Such a dumb nee-chan.

00:15:40.830 --> 00:15:42.620
I'm sowwy.

00:15:50.130 --> 00:15:51.470
Kana-chan...

00:15:56.890 --> 00:15:59.220
Now it's the opposite from last time.

00:15:59.220 --> 00:16:00.560
Last time?

00:16:00.560 --> 00:16:03.520
When you mistook me and Saku-chan.

00:16:03.520 --> 00:16:04.810
Yeah.

00:16:04.810 --> 00:16:11.490
So, Saku-chan cheered me up, and Shi-chan gave me a huge scolding today.

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:13.700
Did you do something, Kana-chan?

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:16.120
Yeah, to you.

00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:24.670
I've been too selfish, and wasn't looking out for others—for you.

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:27.500
Kana-chan...

00:16:27.500 --> 00:16:31.880
I'm thinking about going to the short-term studio.

00:16:31.880 --> 00:16:33.720
Not their regular course?

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:37.180
I'm not trying to cut corners.

00:16:37.180 --> 00:16:42.390
I'll try my best too, so I can stay with you.

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:44.850
The studio isn't everything,

00:16:44.850 --> 00:16:51.610
so I just wish for us to think about our future together from now on...

00:16:52.360 --> 00:16:54.700
So...

00:16:55.570 --> 00:16:58.240
I'm sorry about everything, Yuki-chan.

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:02.960
We'll always be together, right?

00:17:02.960 --> 00:17:05.580
Yes, forever.

00:17:08.790 --> 00:17:12.050
Oh, Kana-chan, Kana-chan.

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:14.970
This is actually for Shi-chan,

00:17:14.970 --> 00:17:16.970
but do you want to have some now?

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:17.890
Yeah.

00:17:17.890 --> 00:17:20.310
I'm sorry, Shi-chan.

00:17:22.390 --> 00:17:24.690
They're really good at making these.

00:17:24.690 --> 00:17:26.060
I agree!

00:17:26.060 --> 00:17:29.610
A girl at work said that she gained weight because of this job.

00:17:30.400 --> 00:17:32.150
Hey now...

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:34.740
Yuki-chan, Yuki-chan,

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:36.570
you got some around your lip.

00:17:40.450 --> 00:17:42.620
What are you doing, Yuki-chan?

00:17:44.080 --> 00:17:45.960
You wipe it.

00:17:56.380 --> 00:17:57.550
Kana-chan!

00:17:57.550 --> 00:17:58.930
Did you just...

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:01.310
Yes?

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:13.570
You meanie!

00:18:13.570 --> 00:18:15.070
But you asked me to get it off...

00:18:15.070 --> 00:18:19.160
I did, but I didn't!

00:18:19.160 --> 00:18:21.830
You just don't get it!

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:09.960
Hey, Kana-chan,

00:19:11.120 --> 00:19:14.920
this room is a bit more cramped than the last one.

00:19:16.090 --> 00:19:21.180
I'm still with you, so it really doesn't bother me.

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:24.100
But I think this is my first time sleeping against the wall.

00:19:24.100 --> 00:19:26.180
You're right...

00:19:26.180 --> 00:19:30.480
That means you get to get in bed first and warm it...

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:32.810
What?!

00:19:32.810 --> 00:19:35.690
Besides, why aren't you wearing your socks tonight?

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:37.730
But I haven't unpacked...

00:19:37.730 --> 00:19:41.200
I put them out for you earlier.

00:19:42.280 --> 00:19:45.490
I guess it's because I love you.

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:48.040
Yuki-chan,

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:50.500
you're so not fair.

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:51.460
I'm not?

00:19:51.460 --> 00:19:53.210
Totally!

00:19:53.210 --> 00:19:56.090
Well, you're so...

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:57.960
Yes?

00:19:59.450 --> 00:20:02.300
I totally love you.

00:20:03.340 --> 00:20:04.140
Yeah.

00:20:13.100 --> 00:20:16.230
Kanade-senpai is on the other side of this door.

00:20:17.020 --> 00:20:19.440
To think that she's innocently sleeping...

00:20:20.650 --> 00:20:22.400
No, I mustn't!

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:24.660
I know this will bother the neighbors...

00:20:24.660 --> 00:20:27.370
But... my hand is... against my will...

00:20:28.200 --> 00:20:31.540
The Cherry Blossoms
have Bloomed...?

00:20:31.540 --> 00:20:32.960
Hey now...

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:33.660
The Cherry Blossoms
have Bloomed...?
